  "worked_solution": "To raise the product of two numbers to the power of $6$, we can raise each number to the power of $6,$ and then multiply:\n\n$$\n{(-\\frac{1}{5}\\times 7)}^{6}={((-\\frac{1}{5})\\times 7)}^{6}={(-\\frac{1}{5})}^{6}\\times {7}^{6}\n$$",
